The scripts in this repository are released under the MIT License.

The binaries published in releases are built from mpv (LGPL-2.1-or-later when
built with gpl=false), FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1-or-later with version3), libplacebo
(LGPL-2.1-or-later), libass (ISC), dav1d (BSD-2-Clause), and their
dependencies. Each release's VERSIONS.txt names the exact sources.
